  "name": "The Echoing Wall",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 13th; <strong>Weight</strong> 50 lbs.; <strong>Price</strong> 24,000 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis +2 contingent speech steel tower shield has been built in such a way that were a tiny orchestra to wedge it in the ground, build a stage in front of it, and begin to perform, they would have some rather excellent acoustics to go along with the whole being absolutely adorable thing they have going on. Any recitation stored in the echoing wall gains the stereo inflection. When a stored recitation is unleashed as per its chosen triggering condition, one of the recitation's two targets must be yourself, while the other must be another creature within 10 feet. If there are no other creatures within 10 feet, then only you are affected.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Magic Arms and Armor, contingency, translate, creator must know the stereo inflection; <strong>Cost</strong> 12,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truenaming-items#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
